{:name "HelloTS"
 :version "0.1.0"
 :author "Light Table"
 :desc "The first Light Table plugin written in TypeScript. Small on purpose: what it demonstrates is the shape."
 :source "https://github.com/LightTable/LightTable"
 :behaviors "hello.behaviors"

 ;; What this plugin needs, declared rather than discovered. Today Light Table
 ;; reports on this; it does not yet enforce it, because enforcement across the
 ;; whole ecosystem needs manifests to exist first. See plugins/README.md.
 ;;
 ;; :clipboard is the only one: writing a greeting is the single thing this
 ;; plugin does that reaches outside the window.
 :capabilities #{:clipboard}}
